changelog: v1 quintessential 90s East Coast boom-bap pattern — 'boom' kick on 1 and the '&' of 3, 'bap' snare on 2 and 4, hi-hat on every 8th note. Tempo 92 places it in the DJ Premier / Pete Rock pocket.

